{"id":"645534","name":"醪糟元宝汤圆","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/645534/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄米汤圆","amount":"6个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冷水下锅煮冷冻的汤圆。","img":"images/645534/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入醪糟一起煮开。","img":"images/645534/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开以后开小火，打入一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/645534/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小火慢煮3分钟。","img":"images/645534/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮熟后捞出即可。","img":"images/645534/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"汤圆咬一口流汁。","img":"images/645534/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡蛋也是嫩嫩的。","img":"images/645534/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}